{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 的右侧感受词虽然方便扫读，但部分细腻的身体感受被压缩成标签，尤其 S07 的“情欲和执念翻涌”“带点情色的暖意”略显直白，层次不如 X。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"平\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 最明显的优势是让普通观众不用猜人物心理：他为什么收着喜欢、为什么突然不自在、为什么既想靠近又害怕失去，前后都有明确交代，14 段也因此形成了连贯的情感变化，而不是一组情绪片段。X 的关键词突出、感受描写更有身体质感，而且到时出现的设计能配合音乐，但有些心理转折需要观众自行补足，部分感受意象也有重复。综合来看，Y 更容易让没读过原文的观众真正听懂这段关系，同时 X 在感受的细腻度上仍有优势。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fba8366f-a874-4865-849f-d53818202cd8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T051932884286Z", "elapsed_seconds": 69.234, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T05:20:42.123374+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4af4e7c53acd85fdd1e5c970bde75d604cf6eb7ffe5e192a7b48bd39074956c2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc42223